7065160,2023-06-04,Debt collection,Auto debt,False statements or representation,Attempted to collect wrong amount,"US Auto Credit Subject : URGENT - Cease and Desist, Violation of FCRA, and Demand for Lawsuit Dear US Auto Credit, I am writing this letter to express my deep frustration and anger regarding the handling of my account by your company. The documentation provided as validation of the debt clearly indicates that the contract in question is between XXXX XXXX and XXXX XXXX XXXX, and not with US Auto Credit as you have erroneously reported. This is a gross misrepresentation of the facts and a clear violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). 
